{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and take object, if approached, process it, if not, approach it, then scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveRobotToArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached     /> <Action ID = TakeObject     /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     /> <Action ID = ApproachObject     /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject     />",
    "BT": {
